  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Abijah slept with his fathers, and they buried him in the city of David: and Asa his son reigned in his stead. In his days the land was quiet ten years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Asa did",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that which was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good and right in the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his God:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he took away the altars of the strange",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "gods",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the high places, and brake down the images, and cut down the groves:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And commanded Judah to seek the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of their fathers, and to do the law and the commandment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also he took away out of all the cities of Judah the high places and the images: and the kingdom was quiet before him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And he built fenced cities in Judah: for the land had rest, and he had no war in those years; because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had given him rest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore he said unto Judah, Let us build these cities, and make about",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "walls, and towers, gates, and bars,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "while",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the land",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet before us; because we have sought the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God, we have sought",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he hath given us rest on every side. So they built and prospered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Asa had an army",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that bare targets and spears, out of Judah three hundred thousand; and out of Benjamin, that bare shields and drew bows, two hundred and fourscore thousand: all these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mighty men of valour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And there came out against them Zerah the Ethiopian with an host of a thousand thousand, and three hundred chariots; and came unto Mareshah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Asa went out against him, and they set the battle in array in the valley of Zephathah at Mareshah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Asa cried unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his God, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nothing with thee to help, whether with many, or with them that have no power: help us, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God; for we rest on thee, and in thy name we go against this multitude. O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "our God; let not man prevail against thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "smote the Ethiopians before Asa, and before Judah; and the Ethiopians fled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Asa and the people that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with him pursued them unto Gerar: and the Ethiopians were overthrown, that they could not recover themselves; for they were destroyed before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and before his host; and they carried away very much spoil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they smote all the cities round about Gerar; for the fear of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.14.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came upon them: and they spoiled all the cities; for there was exceeding much spoil in them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
